{"id":282,"slug":"282-then-catch-va-finally-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Promise & Async","level":"beginner","question_vi":".then(), .catch() và .finally() hoạt động như thế nào?","question_en":"How do .then(), .catch(), and .finally() work?","answer_vi":"- `.then(...)`: chạy khi Promise thành công.\n- `.catch(...)`: chạy khi có lỗi ở Promise trước đó.\n- `.finally(...)`: luôn chạy sau cùng (dù thành công hay lỗi).\n\nVí dụ:\n```javascript\nfetch(url)\n  .then(r => r.json())\n  .then(data => console.log(data))\n  .catch(err => console.error(err))\n  .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n```\n\nMẹo cho người mới: dùng `finally` để dọn trạng thái UI như `loading`.","answer_en":"- `.then(...)`: runs when the Promise succeeds.\n- `.catch(...)`: runs when an error happens in the previous Promise chain.\n- `.finally(...)`: always runs at the end, success or error.\n\nExample:\n```javascript\nfetch(url)\n  .then(r => r.json())\n  .then(data => console.log(data))\n  .catch(err => console.error(err))\n  .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n```\n\nBeginner tip: use `finally` for UI cleanup, such as turning off loading state.","answer_html_vi":"<ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><code>.then(...)</code>: chạy khi Promise thành công.</li><li><code>.catch(...)</code>: chạy khi có lỗi ở Promise trước đó.</li><li><code>.finally(...)</code>: luôn chạy sau cùng (dù thành công hay lỗi).</li></ul><p class=\"qa-summary\">Ví dụ:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"fetch(url)\n  .then(r =&gt; r.json())\n  .then(data =&gt; console.log(data))\n  .catch(err =&gt; console.error(err))\n  .finally(() =&gt; setLoading(false))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(url)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">r</span> =&gt;</span> r.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">data</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(data))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">catch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">err</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(err))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">finally</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setLoading</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>))</code></pre></div><p>Mẹo cho người mới: dùng <code>finally</code> để dọn trạng thái UI như <code>loading</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><code>.then(...)</code>: runs when the Promise succeeds.</li><li><code>.catch(...)</code>: runs when an error happens in the previous Promise chain.</li><li><code>.finally(...)</code>: always runs at the end, success or error.</li></ul><p class=\"qa-summary\">Example:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"fetch(url)\n  .then(r =&gt; r.json())\n  .then(data =&gt; console.log(data))\n  .catch(err =&gt; console.error(err))\n  .finally(() =&gt; setLoading(false))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(url)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">r</span> =&gt;</span> r.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">data</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(data))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">catch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">err</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">error</span>(err))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">finally</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setLoading</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>))</code></pre></div><p>Beginner tip: use <code>finally</code> for UI cleanup, such as turning off loading state.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Promise.prototype.then()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/then"},{"label":"MDN — Promise.prototype.finally()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/finally"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}